      "writtenOn": "2024-05-08T13:07:36Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Kind of. It is common that 0 or positive values signals success, but negative that something went wrong. Here are simple examples from UART API [1](https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/blob/main/include/zephyr/drivers/uart.h#L916) [2](https://github.com/zephyrproject-rtos/zephyr/blob/main/include/zephyr/drivers/uart.h#L837).",
